<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><title>Website privacy — ZAYA</title><meta name="robots" content="noindex"/></head><body><main class="wrap legal"><a href="/">← Back to ZAYA</a><h1>Website privacy</h1><p>This notice describes the informational ZAYA website. The ZAYA app and future services will have their own notices.</p><h2>Information on this website</h2><p>This website has no account system, advertising cookies or analytics scripts. The motion control saves a preference in your browser’s local storage. You can clear that preference using your browser settings.</p><h2>Guided enquiry preview</h2><p>If you choose “Review my message,” the text you enter is sent through ZAYA’s secure website function to an external AI decision service so it can suggest an enquiry category and priority. Common email, Ethiopian mobile-number and payment-card patterns are removed before the text is sent where possible. Do not enter passwords, card information, identification numbers or an exact home address. The review does not send your enquiry to the ZAYA team. You decide whether to continue by email.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Fonts and images are served with this website. Netlify hosts the site and may process ordinary request information, such as your IP address, when serving it. The optional guided enquiry uses a hosted Jev-compatible decision service operated independently from ZAYA and TypeSafe AI.</p><h2>Contacting the team</h2><p>Email and phone links open your chosen application. If you contact ZAYA, the team receives the information you choose to send. For questions, email <a href="mailto:zayaapp@gmail.com">zayaapp@gmail.com</a>.</p><h2>Product services</h2><p>This website does not collect orders, payments or identity documents. Information about future app data handling will be provided before those services are offered.</p></main></body></html>
